<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>救生艇新闻：博客——保护人类</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/</link><description></description><lastBuildDate>Wed, 02 Sep 2026 15:29:45 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>笑的神经基础</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/the-neural-basis-of-laughter</link><description>然而，通过查看侵入性大脑监测数据（例如医疗中使用的直接电刺激），研究人员在这篇综述论文中绘制出了大脑的“笑声引擎”。&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/the-neural-basis-of-laughter2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 02 Sep 2026 15:29:43 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/the-neural-basis-of-laughter</guid></item><item><title>为什么 LaSc${}_{2}$H${}_{24}$ 与 LaH${}_{10}$ 相比表现出更优异的超导性？</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/why-does-lasc_2h_24-exhibit-superior-superconductivity-compared-with-lah_10</link><description>在这里，作者指出，钪不仅会扭曲氢笼结构，还会在费米能级上产生类似 MgB${}_{2}$ 的 Sc-H 态。这种协同作用增强了电子-声子耦合，将强耦合的HH态与费米表面上广泛分布的Sc-H态统一起来，并导致具有更高超导性的各向同性单能隙超导。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/why-does-lasc_2h_24-exhibit-superior-superconductivity-compared-with-lah_102.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 02 Sep 2026 15:14:43 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/why-does-lasc_2h_24-exhibit-superior-superconductivity-compared-with-lah_10</guid></item><item><title>原发性中枢神经系统淋巴瘤皮质类固醇治疗后的放射学反应及其对总生存期的预测价值：一项多中心研究</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/radiological-response-of-primary-central-nervous-system-lymphoma-after-corticosteroid-therapy-and-its-predictive-value-on-overall-survival-a-multicenter-study</link><description>原发性中枢神经系统大 B 细胞淋巴瘤 (PCNS-LBCL) 是一种罕见的侵袭性肿瘤，通常对皮质类固醇治疗 (CST) 敏感。这项多中心研究调查了常规 CST 的放射学反应范围，并评估了其对患者预后的影响。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/radiological-response-of-primary-central-nervous-system-lymphoma-after-corticosteroid-therapy-and-its-predictive-value-on-overall-survival-a-multicenter-study2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 02 Sep 2026 14:59:43 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/radiological-response-of-primary-central-nervous-system-lymphoma-after-corticosteroid-therapy-and-its-predictive-value-on-overall-survival-a-multicenter-study</guid></item><item><title>大学炸弹客预言了奇点吗？特德·卡辛斯基的警告</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/did-the-unabomber-predict-the-singularity-ted-kaczynskis-warning</link><description>16岁，他进入哈佛。 25 岁的他是伯克利有史以来聘用的最年轻的助理教授。 27 岁时，他远离了这一切，走进了蒙大拿州的一间小屋，那里没有电，也没有自来水。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/did-the-unabomber-predict-the-singularity-ted-kaczynskis-warning.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 02 Sep 2026 14:44:43 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/did-the-unabomber-predict-the-singularity-ted-kaczynskis-warning</guid></item><item><title>X 上的闪亮科学 (@ShiningScience)</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/shining-science-shiningscience-on-x</link><description>X 上的闪亮科学：🚨 麻省理工学院一项突破性的大脑扫描研究表明，依赖 ChatGPT 会削弱批判性思维和记忆连线。&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/shining-science-shiningscience-on-x2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 02 Sep 2026 14:29:43 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/shining-science-shiningscience-on-x</guid></item><item><title>模拟表明，巨大的撞击可能在五小时内形成完整的月球</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/giant-impact-could-have-formed-an-intact-moon-within-five-hours-simulations-suggest</link><description>&lt;img src="https://politepaul.com/fd/dtDF30237DhP.xml" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 02 Sep 2026 14:14:43 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/giant-impact-could-have-formed-an-intact-moon-within-five-hours-simulations-suggest</guid></item><item><title>数学模型发现，打开和关闭重力会使粒子落后</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/switching-gravity-on-and-off-leaves-particles-behind-mathematical-model-finds</link><description>重力是时间梯度的产物，没有空间扭曲。更重要的是，几乎所有物理公式中变量“时间”的存在可能意味着所有其他“力”也是时间的导数。而光速是时间速度的测速仪，并不是一个独立的物理常数。难道这就是“大一统”吗？ &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/switching-gravity-on-and-off-leaves-particles-behind-mathematical-model-finds2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 02 Sep 2026 13:59:43 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/switching-gravity-on-and-off-leaves-particles-behind-mathematical-model-finds</guid></item><item><title>一种无需言语即可廉价思考的新型人工智能</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/a-new-kind-of-ai-that-does-its-thinking-cheaply-without-words</link><description>城里可能很快就会出现一种新型人工智能，它使用一种新颖的思维方法，可以节省大量的计算能力和金钱。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/a-new-kind-of-ai-that-does-its-thinking-cheaply-without-words2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 02 Sep 2026 13:44:43 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/a-new-kind-of-ai-that-does-its-thinking-cheaply-without-words</guid></item><item><title>基于人工智能的 AdaptiveFlow 重新定义了药物发现的大规模云计算</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/ai-informed-adaptiveflow-redefines-large-scale-cloud-computing-for-drug-discovery</link><description>研究人员今天宣布推出 AdaptiveFlow，这是一个人工智能平台，可以虚拟筛选数十亿种药物分子，与现有方法相比，计算成本降低了 1,000 倍。 AdaptiveFlow 由圣裘德儿童研究医院、帕维亚大学、达纳法伯癌症研究所和哈佛医学院的科学家开发和验证，允许常规进行昂贵的超大型虚拟药物筛选。开源平台是&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/ai-informed-adaptiveflow-redefines-large-scale-cloud-computing-for-drug-discovery2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 02 Sep 2026 13:29:43 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/ai-informed-adaptiveflow-redefines-large-scale-cloud-computing-for-drug-discovery</guid></item><item><title>寻找暗物质的实验取得了令人惊讶的结果</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/experiment-sees-surprising-result-in-search-for-dark-matter</link><description>一个世纪以来的大部分时间里，人们一直在试图了解暗物质。这种看不见的物质约占宇宙质量的 85%，但从未被直接探测到。准确确定它是什么仍然是我们这个世界最大的问题之一。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/experiment-sees-surprising-result-in-search-for-dark-matter.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 02 Sep 2026 13:14:43 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/experiment-sees-surprising-result-in-search-for-dark-matter</guid></item></channel></rss>